  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> ¡Hola! ~ 歡迎來到藥水配方：像素重鑄版！</strong>\n</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">感謝這個資源包，您在製作自己的藥水時將獲得額外幫助，讓過程更輕鬆，並節省您在釀造任何藥水時的大量時間，無論何時何地。\n<br>\n您所需的所有幫助，就在釀造台介面中！\n<br>\n</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b46eb6k-TWw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fpixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fshadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSPixelForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"無需依賴\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n  <strong> 此資源包完美適用於原版Minecraft - 無需額外模組。</strong> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/16b6589f1f80535554e90efd303b5eb53deccc80.png\" alt=\"擁抱黑暗面\" width=\"550\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-dark-mode-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0593dc091108c8dd613ae3b553c4ff977094f5a_0.webp\" alt=\"藥水配方：黑暗模式\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"更多有趣的項目\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:center\"> \n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shadows-pixels-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"Shadow's Pixels Reforged 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-night-of-living-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"活屍南瓜之夜 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-vanilla-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5db9aeeeca92f223aeae14f2d48078dee1556f14.png\" alt=\"藥水配方：原版版 圖示\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"您的支持與眾不同\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果您喜歡我製作的內容，別猶豫，快加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi，享受所有獨家會員專屬內容。您將能獲取許多額外內容，例如進行中的作品、幕後花絮、開發部落格等等！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"加入 Ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"加入 Patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"常見問題\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<h4><strong> 問：藥水配方：像素重鑄版是一個模組/模組包/資料包/插件嗎...？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：不，這只是一個資源包！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：您能/會製作 Bedrock 版本嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：要製作能在 Bedrock 上運行的版本，我需要學習 Bedrock 的運作方式。所以目前我還沒有這個計畫，但最終會實現的。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：您現在或將來會製作模組嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：目前我只製作資源包，但我並不排除在不久的將來製作一些與藥水配方相關的新內容。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 問：我可以將您的資源包放入我的模組包中嗎？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：可以，只要您標明出處即可。\n\n</div>",
